Memes are in a certain way cultural artifacts reflecting shared social norms and values.

Both black humor and gallows humor allow those in dire situations to build something over their adversaries.

Questions arise about whether alleged perpetrators should be protected by rules of ‘civilized’ communication imposed by certain things, even in the context of war. 
Memes are virally-transmitted cultural artifacts reflecting shared social norms and values.

Both black humor and gallows humor allow those in dire situations to build a sense of superiority over their adversaries.

Questions arise about whether alleged perpetrators should be protected by rules of ‘civilized’ communication imposed by some social media platforms, even in the context of war.

