<accept> The content explicitly states, "Projects along these lines include Searobend, 6 Sphaera, 7 MusicKG, 8 and NotaryPedia. 9 With the exception of MusicKG ( Eyharabide et al., 2019), they have not made a public endpoint available for SPARQL queries." This directly matches the claim. </accept>

